# Standard .gitignore file for .NET Core projects

## User-specific files
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## IDE-specific folders
.vs/
.idea/

## Files generated by Visual Studio
*.csproj.user
*.vcxproj.filters
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb

## Roslyn files
*.ruleset

## NuGet packages
# It's better to restore these using 'dotnet restore'
*.nupkg
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
packages/

## Test results
TestResults/

## Environment files
.env

## Other
*.log
*.tlog
*.DS_Store

## Publishing output
publish/

## Secrets
# Keep sensitive information out of your repository
secrets.json
appsettings.Development.json